# Screenshot placeholders

Replace each placeholder image in the READMEs with the actual screenshot:

Replace each placeholder image in the READMEs with the actual screenshot.
Current screenshots are JPG. Replace with any format — just match `src` in README.

| File | Description |
|--------------------------|-------------|
| `screenshot-main.*` | Full window: terminal + sidebar + quick commands bar + split panes |
| `screenshot-split-panes.*` | Multi-tab + different servers + split pane layout |
| `screenshot-quick-commands.*` | Bottom bar + group dropdown + hover effect |
| `screenshot-float-window.*` | Popup window + search filter + session list |
| `screenshot-file-manager.*` | File tree + download progress + right-click menu |
| `screenshot-agents.*` | Sidebar agent buttons + Claude Code running in terminal |
| `screenshot-mcp-audit.*` | Activity log + calendar picker + filter |
| `screenshot-theme-comparison.*` | Light vs dark theme side by side |

Recommended: 2x resolution (retina), ~90% width in README (70% for float window).
